-- ============================================================================
-- Migration: Add marketing_mail_templates to site_settings
-- Description: Inserts marketing_mail_templates into site_settings with
--              3 templates (sponsored_feature, new_tool_launch, affiliate_partnership).
--              Uses exact Toolbit design system matching confirm_email.html:
--                - #f9f8f6 background with #e4e2db card container
--                - Official apple-icon.png logo + Toolbit.ai teal #0d9488 branding
--                - Figtree typography & clean link colors (#0d9488)
--                - Bold tool and company variables (**{{tool_name}}**, **{{company_name}}**)
--                - Clean professional punctuation (no em-dashes)
--                - Clean seamless signature without dividing line
--                - Centered footer with copyright on a new line
-- ============================================================================

