      "text": "Hi {{recipient_name}},\n\nI'm reaching out from Toolbit.ai, a discovery platform where users search, compare, and find AI tools across a wide range of categories and use cases.\n\nWhile going through tools in the AI space, I came across **{{tool_name}}** and thought it would be a strong fit for the audience we're building on Toolbit - users actively looking for capable, relevant AI solutions.\n\nAs part of our ongoing efforts to support quality AI products, we're currently offering select companies additional visibility on the platform. Depending on the product and your promotional goals, this can take the form of either a complimentary featuring opportunity or a paid placement option - each designed to help **{{tool_name}}** stand out to our growing user base beyond a standard listing.\n\nI'd be happy to walk you through what's available and help figure out which option would work best for **{{tool_name}}** at this stage.\n\nWould you be open to taking a look at the details? I'd be glad to share more whenever convenient for you.\n\nBest regards,\nToolbit Team\nToolbit.ai\nhttps://www.toolbit.ai/",
