ur end would be:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 20px; padding-left: 24px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46;'><li style='margin-bottom: 8px;'>Getting set up with your tracking link.</li><li style='margin-bottom: 8px;'>Featuring <strong style='color: #18181b;'>{{tool_name}}</strong> on relevant category pages, with visibility on our homepage or other high-traffic pages as opportunities arise.</li></ul><p style='margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46; font-size: 15px;'>Would love to hear your thoughts whenever convenient.</p><div style='margin: 24px 0 0; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46; font-size: 15px;'>Best regards,<br>Toolbit Team<br>Toolbit.ai<br><a href='https://www.toolbit.ai/' style='color: #0d9488; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;' target='_blank'>https://www.toolbit.ai/</a></div></td></tr><tr><td align='center' style='padding: 20px 32px 24px 32px; background-color: #faf9f7; border-top: 1px solid #f4f4f5; text-align: center;'><p style='margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-family: Figtree, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #71717a; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;'>You received this email regarding AI tool discovery and partnership opportunities on Toolbit.ai.</p><p style='margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-family: Figtree, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #71717a; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;'><a href='https://www.toolbit.ai/' style='color: #0d9488; text-decoration: underline;' target='_blank'>Home</a> &middot; <a href='https://www.toolbit.ai/contact' style='color: #0d9488; text-decoration: underline;' target='_blank'>Contact</a></p><p style='margin: 0; font-family: Figtree, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #a1a1aa; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;'>&copy; 2026 Toolbit.ai. All rights reserved.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
      "text": "Hi {{recipient_name}},\n\nI'm reaching out from Toolbit.ai, a growing AI tools discovery platform helping users search, compare, and find the relevant AI tools based on their needs and use cases.\n\nWe came across **{{tool_name}}** and think it'd genuinely resonate with our audience. Rather than a standard directory listing, we'd love to explore an affiliate partnership with **{{company_name}}** - where we actively promote **{{tool_name}}** to our users, and earn a commission on the signups/purchases we drive.\n\nCould you let us know:\n\n1. Does **{{company_name}}** currently have an affiliate or referral program?\n2. If yes, could you share the signup link along with the commission structure and cookie duration?\n\nIf you don't currently have a program in place, we'd also be glad to discuss setting up a direct referral partnership instead.\n\nIf this moves forward, next steps on our end would be:\n\n- Getting set up with your tracking link.\n- Featuring **{{tool_name}}** on relevant category pages, with visibility on our homepage or other high-traffic pages as opportunities arise.\n\nWould love to hear your thoughts whenever convenient.\n\nBest regards,\nToolbit Team\nToolbit.ai\nhttps://www.toolbit.ai/",
      "variables": ["{{recipient_name}}", "{{tool_name}}", "{{company_name}}"],
